BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Coit Comedy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-10986676@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Comedy
DESCRIPTION:Coit Comedy\nThursday\, October 1st | Columbus Cafe\n\nCoit Co
 medy is a live stand-up comedy show every last Thursday of the month in th
 e secret basement bar of historic Columbus Cafe in North Beach\, featuring
  some of the best comics from the Bay and beyond.\n\nHosted by local comed
 ians Stoyan Angelov and Sean Derum\, Coit Comedy features the best comics 
 in the bay and beyond including comedians from Cobbs\, SF Punch Line\, Vic
 e Land\, Comedy Central\, Sketch Fest and Don't Tell. The comedy show is i
 n the hidden speakeasy of Columbus Cafe and offers a warm intimate setting
 .\n\nDoors open at 7:30PM and the comedy show starts at 8PM. Parking can b
 e hard to come by in North Beach\, so if you're driving\, you may want to 
 factor in a little extra time for the hunt.\n\nUpon entering\, grab a drin
 k at the upstairs bar and check in near the pool table in the back where y
 ou'll head downstairs to the secret basement to enjoy the show!\n\nThis we
 ek's show features:\n\nColin Braun\nSteven Asifo\nCharlie Norton\nGeulah F
 inman\n\n$12 online - $15 at the door\, 21+\n\nTickets: https://consumer.p
 xf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fcoit-comedy-tickets-
 381499123147%3Faff%3Ddothebay\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/weekly
 /thu/coit-comedy\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/9504870/a8e2f96d-de38-4d34-a873-f0b2ee757a36.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Columbus Cafe\, 562 Green Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94133
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/weekly/thu/coit-comedy
END:VEVENT
