BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LIVE MUSIC: Color Green
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17748467@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:(((folkYEAH!))) presents:\n\nColor Green\n\nFor the California
 -based quartet Color Green\, playing music together is all about stepping 
 into the unknown. “When we play live\, I don’t really know what’s go
 ing to happen\,” says Noah Kohll\, one of the band’s two guitarists an
 d four vocalists. “You really have no idea what you’re going to get wi
 th this band\, which keeps things fresh for us and maybe makes the live ex
 perience special.” In a very short time\, they have developed a word-of-
 mouth reputation as a dynamic and unpredictable live act\, grounding their
  cosmic jams in earthy melodies and drawing from ‘60s SoCal folk-r0ck\, 
 ‘70s classic rock\, ‘80s underground rock\, ‘90s psychedelic dance-r
 ock\, and any other sound that catches their ears.\n\nAdaptable onstage an
 d off\, Color Green has shared stages with a range of groups that reflect 
 both the sophistication and the wild malleability of their sound\, includi
 ng Fuzz\, Kikagaku Moyo\, Circles Around the Sun\, Hiss Golden Messenger\,
  and the Brian Jonestown Massacre. Yet\, because they see boundless possib
 ilities from one note to the next\, they anchor their music in the urgent 
 present rather than the distant past. Color Green can be a million differe
 nt bands without losing their essential hue.\n\nThey capture that wild\, m
 ercurial quality on Fool’s Parade\, a meditation on loss\, grief\, confu
 sion\, frustration\, and the clarity to which they all lead. The album has
  the dynamic of a tight live set\, full of ebbs and flows\, highs and lows
 \, quiet moments lik...\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/4/
 live-music-color-green-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/33981463/28bb2e60-3c94-494e-98d6-e17ad21c89e0.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:4 Star Theater\, 2200 Clement St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/4/live-music-color-green-tickets
END:VEVENT
