BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Union County
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261006T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261006T203000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17874230@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Will Poulter and Noah Centineo deliver pitch-perfect performan
 ces as brothers Cody and Jack Parsons\, each navigating a court-mandated d
 rug rehabilitation program in a pocket of rural Ohio hit hard by the opioi
 d epidemic. Provided with hope for the first time since their struggles be
 gan and with the support of a tireless counselor (Annette Deao)\, the brot
 hers work toward a brighter\, sober future.\n\nPoulter and Centineo blend 
 seamlessly with a supporting cast composed predominantly of non-profession
 al actors as they share their actual experiences\, pain\, and optimism as 
 they\, themselves\, navigate the program. Ohio-born filmmaker Adam Meeks c
 reates a film imbued with realism for an honest\, compassionate portrait o
 f battle being fought across America and the solidarity that flowers on it
 s front lines.\n\nTickets: https://drafthouse.com/sf/show/union-county?cin
 emaId=0802&sessionId=21868\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/6
 /union-county-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7562198;-122.419185
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34575740/fe6712cb-94c7-43ec-a6f6-a3af5d96fa06.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Alamo Drafthouse Cinema\, 2550 Mission St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94110
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/6/union-county-tickets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sammy Rae & The Friends w/ Melt
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261006T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261006T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17196996@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:2nd Show Added!\n\nAnother Planet Entertainment presents\nFall
  2026 Tour\nSammy Rae & The Friends w/ Melt\n\nTuesday\, October 6 | The C
 astro\n\nThe mantra of the Friends?\n\nGo put a smile on somebody’s face
 \, go tell somebody they’ve got a place in this world\, go tell somebody
  you wanna be friends with them.\n\nFor as much as Sammy Rae & The Friends
  may be a band\, this collective of dreamers and artists considers themsel
 ves a family first. That all-for-one and one-for-all camaraderie ignites t
 heir unforgettable and can’t-miss live shows\, which serve as a catharsi
 s for both the musicians and their fervent audience. Fronted by singer/son
 gwriter Sammy Rae and honed through years of touring\, the group is capabl
 e of flourishing in any spotlight thanks to its signature blend of palpabl
 e chemistry\, deft virtuosity\, and vocal fireworks.\n\nTheir sound\, whic
 h has attracted new fans by the thousands in the past few years\, is a uni
 que mélange of Sammy’s influences: classic rock\, folk and funk and spr
 inkled with soul and jazz. Rae has been building toward this moment since 
 moving to NYC from Connecticut in her early 20s. Finding herself without a
  built-in peer group\, she simply built it herself: the literal and prover
 bial Friends. When she started playing shows\, she made sure the audience 
 was part of the family too. Everything that’s happened since – from EP
 ’s “The Good Life” (2018) and “Let’s Throw a Party” (2021) to 
 sold-out shows in major markets and secondary markets alike across North A
 merican an...\n\nall ages\nAnother Planet Entertainment presents: Fall 202
 6 Tour 2nd Show Added!\nListed time is doors\n\nTickets: https://ticketmas
 ter.evyy.net/c/253185/264167/4272?SharedId=DoStuff&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tic
 ketmaster.com%2Fsammy-rae-the-friends-san-francisco-california-10-06-2026%
 2Fevent%2F1C006470DAC1EA51%3Fcamefrom%3DCFC_ANOTHERPLANET_web%26brand%3Dan
 otherplanet\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/6/sammy-rae-the-
 friends-melt-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7619917;-122.4347365
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/31373854/ab64618e-1e7e-410b-83da-84b56958d477.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:The Castro\, 429 Castro St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94114
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/6/sammy-rae-the-friends-melt-ticke
 ts
