DESCRIPTION:6 GNP Stadiums in Mexico City. Over 380\,000 souls. What happe
 ned across those six nights was far\n\nmore than an unprecedented record f
 or Mexican rock\; it was a historic and intimate gathering between a\n\nba
 nd that has soundtracked entire universes and a multigenerational fanbase 
 that is more devoted than\n\never. This is the story of what vibrated on s
 tage and what was kept in the hearts of the fans: an unfiltered\n\nbreakdo
 wn of the absolute magnetism\, nostalgia\, and enduring relevance of Zoé.
 \n\nRuntime\n\n3h 2m\n\nYear\n\n2026\n\nDirector\n\nRodrigo Guardiola\n\nF
 ormat\n\nDCP\n\nCountry\n\nMexico\n\nLanguage\n\nSpanish with English Subt
 itles\n\nFirst Showing\n\nOctober 7\, 2026\n\nCategories\n\nRoxCine\n\n\,\
 n\nFeatured\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/21946?
 siteToken=4m48btf3yavn7xjk5yxk6nc40c\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events
 /2026/10/7/zoe-presents-memorex-rexsexex-y-mas-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
