SUMMARY:Quinteto Latino
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T143000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17207816@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Outdoor & Recreation
DESCRIPTION:A wind quintet with an imperative mission\, Quinteto Latino is
  a singular Bay Area-based chamber ensemble devoted to breaking down the r
 acial and social barriers that have long plagued the classical music world
 . Spotlighting and performing compositions by artists of Latin American he
 ritage\, the quintet’s acclaimed musicians are devoted to building commu
 nity through classical music\, performance and advocacy. With concerts fea
 turing expertly melded flute\, oboe\, clarinet\, French horn and bassoon\,
  QL brings out the vibrant colors and vigorous rhythms of Latin American m
 usic. The group’s programs include arrangements of beloved Latino folk m
 elodies and contemporary works by illustrious composers such as Gabriela L
 ena Frank\, Orlando Jacinto García and Paquito D’Rivera\, including man
 y commissioned by the ensemble.\n\nSupported in part by the Alice M. Ditso
 n Fund of Columbia University.\n\nTickets: https://ybgfestival.org/event/q
 uinteto-latino-2026/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/8/quint
 eto-latino-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7850153;-122.4023464
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/31425241/a7ae8815-4603-4cea-862e-ef73ba36d879.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Yerba Buena Gardens covers two square city blocks bounded by Miss
 ion\, Folsom\, Third and Fourth Streets.\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/8/quinteto-latino-tickets
END:VEVENT
