DESCRIPTION:This is Your City. This is Your Voice. This is Your Future. Sh
 are your story about growing up and raising your family in San Francisco.\
 n\nEvery family has a story. Every voice matters. Please share yours.\n\nJ
 oin us for the District 9 Mission Family Summit! The This Is Your City: Fa
 mily Summit Series invites families\, caregivers\, young people\, and comm
 unity members from across San Francisco to help shape the future of our ci
 ty.\n\nThursday\, Oct. 8\, 2026\, 5:00 p.m. - 7:30 p.m.\n\nThe Women’s B
 uilding\, 3543 18th Street\, SF\, CA 94110\n\nFree food\, childcare\, and 
 interpretation are provided. Please note all interpretation requests must 
 be made 48 hours or more prior to the Family Summit.\n\nWho should attend?
  Everyone is welcome. This event highlights District 9\, but you can atten
 d any Family Summit that fits your schedule.\n\nWhy are we gathering? The 
 Family Summit Series is part of San Francisco's first Citywide Community N
 eeds Assessment. Through conversations with families across the city\, we'
 re learning what matters most to children\, youth\, young adults\, and fam
 ilies. What we learn will help improve future planning\, programs\, and se
 rvices.\n\nWhether you've lived in San Francisco your whole life or recent
 ly made it your home\, your experiences and ideas matter.\n\nDistrict 9 Ne
 ighborhoods include: Mission District\, Bernal Heights\, the Portola\, and
  the Calle 24 Latino Cultural District\n\nFree\nSan Francisco Department o
 f Children\, Youth & Their Families (DCYF)\n\nTickets: https://consumer.px
 f.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fdistrict-9-mission-fa
