DESCRIPTION:After Dark Thursday Nights\n\nEvery Thursday Night | 6–10pm 
 | Exploratorium\, Pier 15\n\nStop scrolling and escape to reality at the E
 xploratorium! Get a little weird with us for evenings worth talking about 
 at After Dark Thursday Nights!\n\nRewire your own brain with our weekly ex
 plorations of science\, art\, and culture. Bring your full self and talk t
 o strangers with art lounges\, trivia nights\, dance parties\, surprising 
 experiments\, performances\, demos\, talks\, and more.\n\nMaybe you’ll p
 lay like no one’s watching with 650+ hands-on exhibits. Maybe you’ll l
 et the week go in the total darkness of the Tactile Dome. Grab a drink\, t
 ry something new\, and go home different. You can’t get more San Francis
 co than this.\n\nAfter Dark Thursday Nights\n6–10 p.m.\nAdults Only (Age
 s 18+)\nThe Exploratorium\, Pier 15\, San Francisco\n\nSee what's next at 
 After Dark!\n\n18+\n\nTickets: https://www.exploratorium.edu/visit/calenda
