 e to Oakland's SHAPESHIFTERS project\, with a party-hardy program of Bay A
 rea magick! Anchoring the Psycho-Geo line-up is none Other than stage magi
 cian extraordinaire Michael Nguyen\, and his bunny Houdini! This master's 
 mind-blowing visual delights are then answered by very different versions 
 of "reality"\, local verite and archival lovelies bearing on our shared sp
 ace and sensibility: Playland\, Berkeley mudflats\, DIY solar ovens\, Bull
 itt production shorts\, James Hong's cine-poems\, sidewalk-busking DJ Beau
  Dayshus\, and the Bay Area premiere of Bill Morrison's Sawyer Ave. AND on
  sale: Not only Maya's charm bracelets\, but also GILBERT's CRAFT BEER!\n\
 nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/10/other-cinema-shapeshifter
