DESCRIPTION:Inner Sunset Flea Market\nTricks\, Treats\, & Treasures\nSunda
 y\, October 11 | 9th - 11th Irving Street | FREE\n\nLaunched in collaborat
 ion with the Inner Sunset Park Neighbors and happening every second Sunday
  from April to November\, this vibrant\, well-loved community event transf
 orms Irving Street (9th–11th Ave.) into a lively community space and mar
 ket filled with vintage and secondhand treasures\, artists and makers\, co
 mmunity organizations\, and more.\n\nTwo blocks of vendors\, live music\, 
 and free family-friendly activities all surrounded by the unique shops and
  eateries of the Inner Sunset neighborhood. And for the first time\, each 
 market features a unique theme and interactive experiences to make the day
  even more special.\n\nInner Sunset Flea Market 2026 Season Schedule\n\nAP
 RIL 12th – “Spring Fling Market”\nMAY 10th – “Mother’s Day”\
 nJUNE 14th – “Celebrating Pride♡”\nJULY 12th – “Garden Party
 ”\nAUGUST 9th – “Dog Days of Summer”\nSEPTEMBER 13th – “A Tast
 e of Comedy Day”\nOCTOBER 11th – “Tricks\, Treats\, & Treasures”\n
 NOVEMBER 8th – “The Big Lunch & Annual Pie Contest”\n\nFree\n\nTicke
 ts: https://sunsetmercantilesf.com/innersunsetflea/\nDetails: https://doth
 ebay.com/events/2026/10/11/inner-sunset-flea-market-tricks-treats-treasure
 s\nSource: DoTheBay
