SUMMARY:Naza
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T200000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17866470@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:NAZA screens at NEW PEOPLE October 9–11 before moving to The
  Roxie starting October 12.\n\nIn secret conversations on the rooftops of 
 Tel Aviv at night\, the systems behind Israel’s calculated mass killing 
 of Palestinian civilians in Gaza are revealed by the people who designed a
 nd operated them.\n\nDirectors Note:\n\nWe made this film out of a sense o
 f obligation to use our position as Israeli filmmakers and journalists to 
 examine the systems behind the mass killing of Palestinian civilians for w
 hich our country is responsible. While filming members of Israel’s milit
 ary on rooftops at night in Tel Aviv over the past three years\, we found 
 ourselves asking the very questions that were asked by our grandparents’
  generation and throughout the 20th century: how does one group of people 
 allow the total dehumanisation of another?\n\nWhat do the inner workings o
 f such a system look like? Many of the revelations in the film were publis
 hed almost immediately as we learned of them\, in the months following the
  October 7th attacks\, by The Guardian (one of NAZA’s producers)\, in co
 llaboration with reporting partners +972 Magazine and Local Call. The film
  lets us explore something deeper than we could in our investigative journ
 alism alone: not only the words being said but also those that are not sai
 d\, the silence. It is up to all of us to break that silence.\n\n– Yuval
  Abraham and Rachel Szor\n\n“An essential\, devastating documentary…th
 ere’s no turning away from what’s said\, you simply can’t unknow wha
 ...\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/22147?siteToke
 n=4m48btf3yavn7xjk5yxk6nc40c\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10
 /13/naza-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7647103;-122.4224081
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34538589/99f1d160-9f3e-4299-9568-8a9dfa325298.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/13/naza-tickets
END:VEVENT
