DESCRIPTION:Wednesdays at Noon. Free RSVP encouraged\, drop-ins are welcom
 e.\n\nMore dates to be announced. Check back often for updates.\n\nNamed S
 an Francisco’s favorite dance workout by the magazines San Francisco and
  7X7\, Rhythm & Motion is a low-pressure\, full-bodied dance workout class
  that balances the euphoria of a good party with the challenge of learning
  choreography and movement techniques. The dance party happens every Wedne
 sday at Yerba Buena Gardens\, when Rhythm & Motion and YBG Festival invite
  you to weekly one-hour dance workout classes in a beautiful outdoor space
 . Wear comfortable clothing and supportive shoes suitable for grass. Bring
  water\, layers for unpredictable weather\, your sense of comfort and conn
 ection and your abundant joy.\n\nFree RSVP\n\nTickets: https://ybgfestival
 .org/event/dance-outdoors-with-rhythm-motion-101426/\nDetails: https://dot
 hebay.com/events/2026/10/14/dance-outdoors-with-rhythm-motion-tickets\nSou
 rce: DoTheBay
