BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hanging By A Wire
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T200000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17856332@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Director Mohammed Ali Naqvi on site for a post-screening Q&A.\
 n\nOn the morning of August 22\, 2023\, eight passengers – six of them s
 choolboys – board a makeshift cable car for what should be a routine com
 mute to school in the mountains of northern Pakistan. Midway across a deep
  ravine\, two of the three supporting cables snap. The gondola lurches vio
 lently and comes to rest\, suspended more than 900 feet above the ground b
 y a singled amaged wire.\n\nWhat follows unfolds in realtime over the cour
 se of one harrowing day – a survival ordeal shaped by uncertainty\, esca
 lating danger\, and the relentless pressure of being watched. The rescue p
 lays out live on national television and social media\, captured from ever
 y angle: panicked families on the ground\, military helicopters battling h
 igh winds\, first responders scrambling for solutions\, drones circling ov
 erhead\, and footage filmed from inside the cablecar itself as hours pass 
 and darkness approaches.\n\nWith no margin for error and a cable that coul
 d fail at any moment\, an unlikely alliance of rescuers must improvise und
 er intense public scrutiny – racing against an invisible clock before di
 saster strikes live on television.\n\n“…provides a dash of thrill\, ma
 gnifying the events of this human interest story to cinematic scope\, and 
 giving audiences a sense of the chaos\, the tension\, and the catharsis of
  that tumultuous day of terror…” – Jason Gorber\, povmagazine.com\n\
 nRuntime\n\n1h 18m\n\nYear\n\n2026\n\nDirector\n\nMohammed Ali Naqvi\n\nFo
 rmat\n\nDCP\n\nCoun...\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purc
 hase/22111?siteToken=4m48btf3yavn7xjk5yxk6nc40c\nDetails: https://dothebay
 .com/events/2026/10/14/hanging-by-a-wire-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7647103;-122.4224081
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34488685/9c034538-3652-44ce-8c66-dded43d3e8dc.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/14/hanging-by-a-wire-tickets
