 wonder-in-your-life-tickets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Arthouse 50: 49 Square Miles Surrounded by Reality: The City Envis
 ioned by Canyon Cinema
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T201500
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17856333@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Canyon Cinema\n\nPart of our Arthouse 50: Celebra
 ting our 50th anniversary as an Arthouse\n\nIn celebration of The Roxie Th
 eater’s 50th year\, this program assembles films made by former and curr
 ent Canyon staffers\, offering manifold views of our shared Bay Area home.
  Urban landscapes familiar and defamiliarized\; flipped upside down\, reve
 rsed\, layered\, blurred\, shrouded\, screwed and glued\, but unmistakably
  SF. Together\, these irreverent depictions evince the city’s charm\, co
 mplexity\, and transformation across five decades.\n\nScreening Line-up (a
 pproximate running time: 70 minutes):\n\nPacific Far East Line (Abigail Ch
 ild\, 1979\, 12 minutes\, color\, silent\, 16mm)\n\nAn urban landscape fil
 m constructed from materials gathered over two years looking out at downto
 wn San Francisco. The elements “folded” and mixed\, Time redefines Spa
 ce: the erector and helicopter appear as toys within a schizy motor-oil-iz
 ed ballet mechanique.\n\nBy the Sea (Toney W. Merritt\, 1982\, 2 minutes\,
  color\, silent\, 16mm)\n\nA film made from my old studio apartment on Tel
 egraph Hill. A portrait of sorts.\n\nCable Car Melody (Charles Wright\, 19
 86\, 26 minutes\, color\, sound\, 16mm)\n\nYou will look down Hyde Street 
 and see San Francisco Bay in the background. In the foreground a cable car
  will move across the surface of the screen\, while almost everything else
  will change\, from shot to shot\, to create a melody.\n\nPremonition (Dom
 inic Angerame\, 1995\, 10 minutes\, b&w\, sound\, 16mm)\n\n“Roads\, brid
 ges\, street lamps and under...\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi
 .com/purchase/22104?siteToken=4m48btf3yavn7xjk5yxk6nc40c\nDetails: https:/
 /dothebay.com/events/2026/10/14/arthouse-50-49-square-miles-surrounded-by-
 reality-the-city-envisioned-by-canyon-cinema-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7647103;-122.4224081
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34488691/b15b7a5b-7cfd-4451-b824-9d3cb420a614.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/14/arthouse-50-49-square-miles-sur
 rounded-by-reality-the-city-envisioned-by-canyon-cinema-tickets
END:VEVENT
