BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:An Evening With moe.
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17436042@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Goldenvoice Presents\nAn Evening With moe.\n\nFriday\, October
  16 | ​The Regency Ballroom\n\nAl Schnier (guitars\, vocals) * Chuck Gar
 vey (guitars\, vocals) * Rob Derhak (bass\, vocals) * Jim Loughlin (percus
 sion\, vibes) * Vinnie Amico (drums)\n\nHailed by American Songwriter for 
 their "mind-bending musicality\," moe. is treasured for their mesmerizing 
 musical synergy\, unfettered showmanship\, and smart\, resonant songcraft.
  For three decades\, the band has corralled myriad musical forms on a trul
 y original journey rich with crafty\, clever songwriting and astonishing r
 esourcefulness. Fueled by an impassioned fan base\, moe. has spent much of
  those thirty years on the road\, encompassing countless live performances
  marked by eclectic wit\, deep friendship\, and exploratory invention. Hav
 ing built an enduring legacy with hard work and a confirmed commitment to 
 creativity and community\, moe. seem as surprised as anyone to find themse
 lves at such a significant landmark.\n\n"The career just very subtly unfol
 ded\," says co-founding bassist-singer-songwriter Rob Derhak\, "without an
 y of us noticing it actually happened."\n\nAl Schnier (guitars\, vocals)\,
  Chuck Garvey (guitars\, vocals)\, and Derhak first came together at the U
 niversity of Buffalo in 1990\, musician-friends uniting to play for the sh
 eer fun of it. The band followed a handful of cassette-only releases with 
 1992's FATBOY\, recorded in an apartment studio above Buffalo's Top Shelf 
 Guitars with a bird's eye view of Mighty Taco.\n\n"We liked music\, we l..
 .\n\nGoldenvoice Presents\n\nTickets: https://www.theregencyballroom.com/e
 vents/detail/?event_id=1468095\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/
 10/16/an-evening-with-moe-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7879104;-122.4215079
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32490785/5f8a147b-90a0-4a08-bf2e-8627ecfe1ba6.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:The Regency Ballroom\, 1290 Sutter Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 
 94109
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/16/an-evening-with-moe-tickets
END:VEVENT
