CATEGORIES:Lecture/Education
DESCRIPTION:Come learn about University of San Francisco School of Educati
 on doctoral\, master's\, and credential programs at our open house.\nParti
 cipate in faculty-led breakout sessions for in-depth discussion about your
  programs of interest. Event attendees will meet with faculty\, get help w
 ith application questions\, attend a current student panel\, and receive a
