 et/32106279/1ff6dee2-13bb-4dc1-90a8-fc0997566801.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/17/zyzzyva-movie-matinee-with-ingr
 id-rojas-contreras-amarcord-35mm-tickets
END:VEVENT
