DESCRIPTION:This is Your City. This is Your Voice. This is Your Future. Sh
 are your story about growing up and raising your family in San Francisco.\
 n\nEvery family has a story. Every voice matters. Please share yours.\n\nJ
 oin us for the District 8 Castro Family Summit! The This Is Your City: Fam
 ily Summit Series invites families\, caregivers\, young people\, and commu
 nity members from across San Francisco to help shape the future of our cit
 y.\n\nSaturday\, Oct. 17\, 2026\, 1:00 p.m. - 3:30 p.m.\n\nEureka Valley R
 ecreation Center\, 100 Collingwood St\, SF\, CA 94114\n\nFree food\, child
 care\, and interpretation are provided. Please note all interpretation req
 uests must be made 48 hours or more prior to the Family Summit.\n\nWho sho
 uld attend? Everyone is welcome. This event highlights District 8\, but yo
 u can attend any Family Summit that fits your schedule.\n\nWhy are we gath
 ering? The Family Summit Series is part of San Francisco's first Citywide 
 Community Needs Assessment. Through conversations with families across the
  city\, we're learning what matters most to children\, youth\, young adult
 s\, and families. What we learn will help improve future planning\, progra
 ms\, and services.\n\nWhether you've lived in San Francisco your whole lif
 e or recently made it your home\, your experiences and ideas matter.\n\nDi
 strict 8 Neighborhoods include: The Castro\, Noe Valley\, Diamond Heights\
 , Glen Park\, Corona Heights\, Eureka Valley\, Dolores Heights\, Mission D
 olores\, Duboce Triangle\, Buena Vista Park\, Cole Valley\, Ashbury Height
 s\, par...\n\nFree\nSan Francisco Department of Children\, Youth & Their F
 amilies (DCYF)\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2F
 www.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fdistrict-8-castro-family-summit-tickets-199654665
